const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文考察市场成交量与日收益一阶序列相关之间的关系，以及流动性交易压力如何参与解释该关系。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper asks how trading volume and first-order serial correlation in daily stock returns relate, including the role of liquidity-motivated order pressure. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2118454",label:{zh:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源同时讨论股票指数和大型个股，并把高低成交活跃度下的收益特征放在做市商承接非信息交易压力的模型中理解。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It considers both an index and large individual stocks, interpreting high- and low-volume return behavior through a market-maker model of noninformational trading pressure. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2118454",label:{zh:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要区分日收益、成交量口径、指数或个股样本、交易日历和定义成交活跃度的时间窗口。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Inputs distinguish daily returns, volume definitions, index or stock samples, trading calendars, and the window used to classify activity. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2118454",label:{zh:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"公开摘要把成交量视为解释收益序列依赖的条件信息，而不是把较高成交量本身变成方向性信号。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The abstract treats volume as conditional information for return dependence, not as a directional signal by itself. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2118454",label:{zh:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结收益调整规则与成交量定义，区分停牌和零成交，并分别记录指数构造、样本存续与非同步交易处理。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Fix the return-adjustment rule and volume definition; distinguish halts from zero volume; document index construction, survivorship, and nonsynchronous-trading treatment. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2118454",label:{zh:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993)。该研究的做市和流动性交易机制不能由分钟 OHLCV 单独观察，更不能直接转写成跨市场的交易规则。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993). The market-making and liquidity-trading mechanism cannot be observed from minute OHLCV alone or rewritten as a cross-market trading rule. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2118454",label:{zh:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Quarterly Journal of Economics (1993) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Trading Volume and Serial Correlation in Stock Returns”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。该研究的做市和流动性交易机制不能由分钟 OHLCV 单独观察，更不能直接转写成跨市场的交易规则。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Trading Volume and Serial Correlation in Stock Returns”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
